License pending

This repository does not yet have a final open-source license.

Recommended default for public projects under this brand: Apache License 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

To adopt Apache-2.0:
  1. Replace this entire LICENSE file with the Apache-2.0 license text
     (or copy from https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt).
  2. Update CITATION.cff `license:` via `npm run citation:gen` (or set Apache-2.0).
  3. Update the README license badge / notice (regenerate with `npm run readme:gen`).
  4. Record the change under CHANGELOG.md [Unreleased].

Until a license is chosen by the repository owner (Sen / @zsenarchitect),
all rights are reserved and contributions are accepted under the
contributor's agreement that the chosen OSI license will apply retroactively
to accepted contributions once LICENSE is finalized.
